{"id":"carro","lemma":"carro","pos":"noun","rank":162,"glosses":["cart (vehicle drawn or pushed by a person or animal)","car; automobile","any “vehicle” which is drawn, such as an elevator, a cable car, or a train wagon"],"ipa":"/ˈka.ʁu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/Pt-br-um_carro.oga/Pt-br-um_carro.oga.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"carros"},"formAudio":{"carros":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-carros.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Espera no carro.","en":"Wait in the car.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/279771","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Há sempre muitos carros nesta rua.","en":"There are always a lot of cars on this street.","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"very, a lot","l":"muito"},null,{"g":"in this"},{"g":"street"}]},{"text":"Esse carro é novo?","en":"Is that a new car?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845329","words":[{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"recently made or created"}]},{"text":"Não é o meu carro.","en":"It's not my car.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1272159","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"my, mine"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"isn't it"]]},{"text":"Tenho dois carros.","en":"I have two cars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/46184","words":[{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"deuce"},null]}]}